Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start receiving the claim") -> action(n2,"Create and record the claim") -> action(n3,"Make decision on the claim") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n4,"Then reject it") -> action(n6,"Review the claim rejection") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c_join) -> branch(b3,AND) -> action(n12,"Operate outgoing payment") -> converge(c2) -> action(n14,"End") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start receiving the claim") -> action(n2,"Create and record the claim") -> action(n3,"Make decision on the claim") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n4,"Then reject it") -> action(n6,"Review the claim rejection") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c_join) -> branch(b3,AND) -> action(n13,"Close the claim") -> converge(c2) -> action(n14,"End") -> end(e1)